1
00:00:00,982 --> 00:00:04,320
(Episode 13)

2
00:00:13,086 --> 00:00:14,137
Drink this.

3
00:00:19,789 --> 00:00:20,872
Jun Seo.

4
00:00:22,965 --> 00:00:25,698
Do you really need to go to the U.S.?

5
00:00:31,276 --> 00:00:35,999
Can you live with me...

6
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,451
just for six months?

7
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,787
Just for six months...

8
00:00:47,112 --> 00:00:51,674
I'm not asking for any more,
just six months.

9
00:00:53,367 --> 00:00:54,458
Could you do that?

10
00:00:59,993 --> 00:01:01,189
Eun Seo.

11
00:01:04,961 --> 00:01:06,541
What's going on with you?

12
00:01:08,682 --> 00:01:13,981
Can't you live with me?

13
00:01:18,682 --> 00:01:19,733
Can't you?

14
00:01:20,916 --> 00:01:22,083
It is...

15
00:01:27,475 --> 00:01:28,642
too late now.

16
00:01:29,295 --> 00:01:32,155
What are you talking about?
What is too late?

17
00:01:33,233 --> 00:01:35,579
You'll live with Yu Mi
for the rest of your life.

18
00:01:35,579 --> 00:01:37,445
Why can't you live with me for six months?

19
00:01:37,445 --> 00:01:38,696
Eun Seo.

20
00:01:42,109 --> 00:01:43,696
Why are you doing this?

21
00:01:45,413 --> 00:01:48,810
Can't I ask you for this?

22
00:01:48,810 --> 00:01:50,270
Can't I do that?

23
00:01:51,890 --> 00:01:53,489
I like you.

24
00:01:53,489 --> 00:01:56,034
I like you a lot.

25
00:01:56,034 --> 00:01:58,243
But why do I have to give you up?

26
00:01:58,243 --> 00:02:01,838
Why do I have to put up with it?
Why am I the only one?

27
00:02:13,433 --> 00:02:15,388
Do you want to live with me,

28
00:02:19,431 --> 00:02:21,240
letting Yu Mi give up on her life?

29
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:25,312
Can you do that?

30
00:02:27,351 --> 00:02:28,648
Can you?

31
00:02:32,111 --> 00:02:33,111
No.

32
00:02:36,972 --> 00:02:38,114
No, I can't.

33
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,341
Eun Seo.

34
00:02:49,906 --> 00:02:51,291
This is the only thing...

35
00:02:56,650 --> 00:02:58,463
I can do now.

36
00:03:50,411 --> 00:03:52,103
We're seeing each other twice today.

37
00:03:52,983 --> 00:03:54,098
Would you like water?

38
00:03:55,666 --> 00:03:57,011
Why don't we have something strong?

39
00:04:07,031 --> 00:04:08,524
Did something happen to Eun Seo?

40
00:04:12,327 --> 00:04:13,930
What's going on with her?

41
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:20,198
Nothing's going on. Did you meet Eun Seo?

42
00:04:22,036 --> 00:04:23,372
She came to meet me.

43
00:04:26,330 --> 00:04:30,725
Are you sure nothing's happened to her?

44
00:04:32,810 --> 00:04:33,941
Are you sure?

45
00:04:38,042 --> 00:04:40,358
I don't think you can ask me about her.

46
00:04:41,105 --> 00:04:42,364
Do you think you can?

47
00:04:43,778 --> 00:04:45,748
Do you think you have the right to ask?

48
00:04:47,786 --> 00:04:50,185
I'm taking care of her now.

49
00:04:50,185 --> 00:04:51,714
You needn't get bothered about it.

50
00:04:58,117 --> 00:04:59,170
Hello.

51
00:05:00,765 --> 00:05:01,765
Yes.

52
00:05:06,446 --> 00:05:10,047
Yes, this is Han Tae Seok who asked.

53
00:05:12,150 --> 00:05:13,150
(Cancer Can Be Beaten,
Road to the Complete Cure)

54
00:05:13,150 --> 00:05:14,150
What?

55
00:05:14,704 --> 00:05:15,947
Did she faint?

56
00:05:22,825 --> 00:05:24,824
I'm sorry. I need to go now.

57
00:05:24,824 --> 00:05:26,627
What's going on? Who fainted?

58
00:05:33,282 --> 00:05:35,781
A friend. You don't need to know.

59
00:05:41,593 --> 00:05:44,419
(Emergency Medical Center)

60
00:05:48,810 --> 00:05:50,159
How are you feeling?

61
00:05:53,099 --> 00:05:54,239
Doctor.

62
00:05:55,351 --> 00:05:56,887
Please save me, doctor.

63
00:05:58,443 --> 00:05:59,743
Save me.

64
00:06:02,475 --> 00:06:04,197
Please save me, doctor.

65
00:06:05,931 --> 00:06:07,262
Save me.

66
00:06:10,899 --> 00:06:14,449
I am scared, doctor. I am scared.

67
00:06:16,008 --> 00:06:17,248
Please save me.

68
00:07:31,632 --> 00:07:34,627
Can you live with me...

69
00:07:35,647 --> 00:07:37,267
just for six months?

70
00:07:41,064 --> 00:07:42,675
Jun Seo, I'm back.

71
00:07:43,418 --> 00:07:44,644
Jun Seo?

72
00:07:48,312 --> 00:07:49,548
Jun Seo.

73
00:07:59,994 --> 00:08:01,285
Jun Seo.

74
00:08:03,121 --> 00:08:04,211
Yu Mi.

75
00:08:07,775 --> 00:08:10,331
Could you give me some time?

76
00:08:11,143 --> 00:08:12,667
Just a few months...

77
00:08:13,464 --> 00:08:16,076
If I ask that I do whatever I like
for a few months...

78
00:08:16,076 --> 00:08:18,939
and promise to come back to you,

79
00:08:21,592 --> 00:08:22,611
could you...

80
00:08:25,281 --> 00:08:29,692
allow me to do that?

81
00:08:32,802 --> 00:08:33,948
Go.

82
00:08:35,017 --> 00:08:36,364
Go away.

83
00:08:37,065 --> 00:08:40,385
Go away, not for a few months,
but forever.

84
00:08:40,385 --> 00:08:41,733
Just go away.

85
00:08:43,147 --> 00:08:44,906
What's the point of all this?

86
00:08:44,906 --> 00:08:46,540
What's the point?

87
00:08:48,563 --> 00:08:49,563
Yu Mi.

88
00:08:50,914 --> 00:08:52,629
Do you take me for a fool?

89
00:08:52,629 --> 00:08:53,973
Am I a fool?

90
00:08:54,621 --> 00:08:57,628
Why are you making me so miserable?

91
00:08:57,628 --> 00:08:59,139
If you'd like to keep doing this, just go.

92
00:08:59,139 --> 00:09:00,222
Go away.

93
00:09:07,523 --> 00:09:08,797
Don't leave.

94
00:09:24,615 --> 00:09:26,880
Why is it so difficult to make it?

95
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,418
Are you feeling better?

96
00:09:33,615 --> 00:09:36,241
How are you feeling? Are you in any pain?

97
00:09:37,494 --> 00:09:39,786
I'm sorry I scared you.

98
00:09:40,911 --> 00:09:41,931
I'm leaving now.

99
00:09:57,887 --> 00:09:59,772
I found the hospital.

100
00:09:59,772 --> 00:10:02,298
They want you to be admitted immediately.

101
00:10:02,298 --> 00:10:05,543
I have sent them
your medical records already.

102
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:07,477
Tae Seok.

103
00:10:07,477 --> 00:10:08,480
Listen.

104
00:10:09,172 --> 00:10:10,488
Listen to me.

105
00:10:13,149 --> 00:10:16,540
We can beat this.
It's just difficult to cure.

106
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:18,337
I heard it's not necessarily
a fatal disease.

107
00:10:19,349 --> 00:10:21,356
The hospital I found...

108
00:10:21,356 --> 00:10:24,229
has a lake nearby,
and the scenery is also beautiful.

109
00:10:24,229 --> 00:10:28,040
Also, it's the best hospital
for treating cancer in Korea.

110
00:10:28,813 --> 00:10:33,103
If they can't fix you,
I'll take you to any hospital that can.

111
00:10:35,037 --> 00:10:39,280
I'll do my best to save you.

112
00:10:40,205 --> 00:10:41,261
I will.

113
00:10:49,461 --> 00:10:54,821
I know you're thinking about giving up.

114
00:10:54,821 --> 00:10:56,329
You're about to give up.

115
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,979
Eun Seo.

116
00:11:04,958 --> 00:11:06,560
Do you want me to tell Jun Seo?

117
00:11:09,269 --> 00:11:10,464
Should I tell him?

118
00:11:14,767 --> 00:11:19,497
Should I let Jun Seo know you're sick?

119
00:11:22,552 --> 00:11:24,735
Please don't tell him.

120
00:11:24,735 --> 00:11:26,290
Don't, Tae Seok.

121
00:11:27,648 --> 00:11:31,550
He's leaving for the U.S. soon,
so he doesn't need to know.

122
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:33,536
He shouldn't know it.
He should never know it.

123
00:11:41,262 --> 00:11:42,649
I'm sorry, Tae Seok.

124
00:11:45,934 --> 00:11:47,024
I'm sorry.

125
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:53,865
I shouldn't be so mean to you like this.

126
00:12:05,926 --> 00:12:07,599
Don't be sorry.

127
00:12:09,190 --> 00:12:11,216
You don't need to be sorry, Eun Seo.

128
00:12:12,064 --> 00:12:15,178
So, please go to the hospital with me.

129
00:12:16,999 --> 00:12:22,194
Since you've been mean to me until now,

130
00:12:23,815 --> 00:12:26,027
you should give me a chance at least.

131
00:12:29,303 --> 00:12:31,523
What if I can't do anything...

132
00:12:33,664 --> 00:12:35,099
and you die?

133
00:12:37,705 --> 00:12:38,963
What should I do?

134
00:12:42,503 --> 00:12:44,924
If I'm aware that you're sick
yet can't do anything,

135
00:12:47,871 --> 00:12:49,530
how could I live with myself?

136
00:12:53,185 --> 00:12:56,581
It's not for you. It's for me.

137
00:12:58,796 --> 00:13:02,046
Please go to the hospital for me.

138
00:13:05,932 --> 00:13:06,940
Don't you think...

139
00:13:08,872 --> 00:13:11,212
you should do it for me at least?

140
00:13:14,386 --> 00:13:16,396
Think about what you've done to me.

141
00:13:28,504 --> 00:13:30,288
Do you really want to die?

142
00:13:30,288 --> 00:13:32,418
Are you going to die?

143
00:13:36,455 --> 00:13:37,713
I want to live.

144
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,874
I want to live.

145
00:14:47,875 --> 00:14:48,949
Eun Seo,

146
00:14:49,851 --> 00:14:52,090
what are you doing?

147
00:14:52,903 --> 00:14:55,072
I'm just polishing dishes.

148
00:14:55,072 --> 00:14:56,968
I know you don't have time for this.

149
00:14:57,631 --> 00:14:59,251
Leave it.

150
00:14:59,251 --> 00:15:02,264
It's always been your job.
What's so special about it this time?

151
00:15:02,264 --> 00:15:05,624
Right, I always do this,

152
00:15:05,624 --> 00:15:08,017
so I'll polish all the dishes
while I have the time.

153
00:15:09,703 --> 00:15:10,743
By the way,

154
00:15:12,237 --> 00:15:14,074
- Mom.
- Yes?

155
00:15:15,205 --> 00:15:17,639
I found a job.

156
00:15:19,725 --> 00:15:20,835
Did you?

157
00:15:20,835 --> 00:15:25,800
I got hired at a big hotel in Seoul.

158
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,178
Isn't that great?

159
00:15:27,178 --> 00:15:31,052
Also, these are your socks,
and these are your lingerie.

160
00:15:32,731 --> 00:15:34,257
And...

161
00:15:36,215 --> 00:15:37,696
this.

162
00:15:37,696 --> 00:15:39,030
Do you like it?

163
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:42,414
Take it away. Are you out of your mind?
What is all this?

164
00:15:42,414 --> 00:15:44,632
I don't need any of that.

165
00:15:45,334 --> 00:15:47,239
Also, what is this lingerie for?

166
00:15:47,239 --> 00:15:48,898
It's more than enough
to wear for the rest of my life.

167
00:15:50,144 --> 00:15:53,473
It'll be nice if you could wear them
for the rest of your life.

168
00:15:56,046 --> 00:16:01,170
I just bought you some you can wear
for the rest of your life, didn't I?

169
00:16:02,336 --> 00:16:04,633
Are you not coming back
once you go to Seoul?

170
00:16:07,648 --> 00:16:10,613
Mom, look at this. Isn't it pretty?

171
00:16:10,613 --> 00:16:12,325
Try it on.

172
00:16:12,325 --> 00:16:13,390
What's wrong with you?

173
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:15,038
- No.
- Come on, Mom.

174
00:16:19,830 --> 00:16:22,252
You look great.

175
00:16:22,252 --> 00:16:23,878
My mom is beautiful.

176
00:16:25,075 --> 00:16:26,814
I believe I look like you.

177
00:16:29,836 --> 00:16:35,574
It was my wish to get you
a beautiful winter jacket.

178
00:16:38,275 --> 00:16:39,758
Do you feel sorry for me?

179
00:16:40,491 --> 00:16:43,495
No, I feel grateful for you.

180
00:16:45,339 --> 00:16:47,175
Mom, thank you so much.

181
00:16:48,802 --> 00:16:52,798
I want to give you only the best things.

182
00:16:54,715 --> 00:16:58,093
I'll show you my best.

183
00:17:28,268 --> 00:17:29,758
Do you want to get off work with me?

184
00:17:34,275 --> 00:17:37,286
You and Jun Seo just turned
the whole family upside down.

185
00:17:38,764 --> 00:17:41,205
How shameless you are.

186
00:17:43,506 --> 00:17:44,674
I'm sorry.

187
00:17:44,674 --> 00:17:47,888
I can't since I'm on duty tonight.

188
00:17:47,888 --> 00:17:48,988
Sin Ae.

189
00:17:51,984 --> 00:17:55,370
I came here to ask you a favor.

190
00:17:56,130 --> 00:17:58,820
A favor? To me?

191
00:18:02,354 --> 00:18:04,015
I'm going to Seoul.

192
00:18:04,015 --> 00:18:05,363
I'm going to work in Seoul.

193
00:18:07,752 --> 00:18:09,803
I won't come back for a long time.

194
00:18:13,089 --> 00:18:14,361
Mom.

195
00:18:15,936 --> 00:18:17,618
My mom.

196
00:18:18,897 --> 00:18:21,978
Please look after her.

197
00:18:26,146 --> 00:18:29,378
I have no one to ask but you.

198
00:18:31,136 --> 00:18:34,058
You know how Jong Chul is.

199
00:18:35,906 --> 00:18:37,276
I have only you to ask this.

200
00:18:39,898 --> 00:18:45,035
Please come by her once in a while
after I'm gone.

201
00:18:47,609 --> 00:18:53,754
Mom has only you besides me.

202
00:18:56,448 --> 00:18:57,591
Do you have anything else to say?

203
00:18:59,904 --> 00:19:01,571
As for your mom...

204
00:19:04,089 --> 00:19:09,651
I won't see her often anymore.

205
00:19:11,465 --> 00:19:14,274
So, I want to sleep over
at your house tonight.

206
00:19:16,201 --> 00:19:18,764
Can you let me do that, just for today?

207
00:19:20,337 --> 00:19:22,224
You're being ridiculous.

208
00:19:22,224 --> 00:19:23,458
Why are you acting like
you're dying or something?

209
00:19:28,272 --> 00:19:29,314
Am I?

210
00:19:36,015 --> 00:19:37,277
Sin Ae.

211
00:19:39,633 --> 00:19:42,846
Please.

212
00:19:43,369 --> 00:19:45,667
Why do I have to look after your mom?

213
00:19:47,537 --> 00:19:49,241
Bye.

214
00:19:49,241 --> 00:19:52,844
I don't want to see you ever again.

215
00:20:09,728 --> 00:20:10,835
Mom.

216
00:20:12,992 --> 00:20:14,203
You hate me, don't you?

217
00:20:17,153 --> 00:20:18,427
What are you talking about?

218
00:20:21,968 --> 00:20:23,932
How can I hate you, Eun Seo?

219
00:20:26,999 --> 00:20:32,731
Whenever I think of you,

220
00:20:33,848 --> 00:20:36,347
it makes me so happy.

221
00:20:38,608 --> 00:20:39,608
Is that true?

222
00:20:42,271 --> 00:20:43,330
Of course.

223
00:20:48,224 --> 00:20:49,224
Of course.

224
00:20:54,473 --> 00:20:55,816
I'm sorry, Mom.

225
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:03,762
It would've been better if I hadn't been
your daughter from the beginning.

226
00:21:06,517 --> 00:21:07,563
No, it wouldn't.

227
00:21:09,606 --> 00:21:10,712
It wouldn't.

228
00:21:12,911 --> 00:21:18,033
I'm so happy I had you.

229
00:21:21,438 --> 00:21:25,890
We were apart. We had our hearts broken,

230
00:21:29,281 --> 00:21:31,826
and it's been hard for us
because of you and Jun Seo.

231
00:21:34,856 --> 00:21:38,011
But compared to the happiness
you brought me,

232
00:21:39,480 --> 00:21:40,994
all those things are nothing.

233
00:21:44,273 --> 00:21:45,884
When you were little,

234
00:21:48,263 --> 00:21:51,276
you plucked a flower for me
for the first time.

235
00:21:53,529 --> 00:21:56,786
It was a breathtaking moment.

236
00:22:00,024 --> 00:22:03,602
The flower was crushed in your tiny hand,

237
00:22:05,888 --> 00:22:09,538
but you walked to me as a toddler.

238
00:22:13,752 --> 00:22:15,828
You have no idea how happy I was.

239
00:22:21,207 --> 00:22:22,290
My daughter.

240
00:22:28,032 --> 00:22:29,065
Mom.

241
00:22:31,329 --> 00:22:32,787
Are you going to cry?

242
00:22:34,834 --> 00:22:37,084
Why are you crying, silly?

243
00:23:20,210 --> 00:23:24,436
Now it's like we're always together,
isn't it?

244
00:23:25,658 --> 00:23:26,748
Right?

245
00:23:28,018 --> 00:23:32,221
Dad and Mom, goodbye.

246
00:23:38,755 --> 00:23:43,647
Jun Seo, goodbye.

247
00:23:49,666 --> 00:23:51,854
Hello, Director, you're here.

248
00:23:52,467 --> 00:23:55,379
You've been taking good care
of my sister, Eun Seo,

249
00:23:55,379 --> 00:23:56,707
and found her a job in Seoul.

250
00:23:56,707 --> 00:24:00,550
It's all right.
I might have favors to ask you later.

251
00:24:03,503 --> 00:24:06,654
Can you get your blood tested
at this hospital?

252
00:24:06,654 --> 00:24:09,233
What? A blood test?

253
00:24:09,839 --> 00:24:12,870
I don't have any disease.

254
00:24:12,870 --> 00:24:14,115
It's not about that.

255
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:18,570
I'm asking you a favor.

256
00:24:19,784 --> 00:24:22,602
Sure, you can ask me.

257
00:24:22,602 --> 00:24:26,135
I'll do anything you ask me.

258
00:24:33,766 --> 00:24:34,806
Hello.

259
00:24:36,324 --> 00:24:37,958
I'm going to Seoul too, Ms. Soon Im.

260
00:24:38,918 --> 00:24:41,008
I'll come by often to see how she is.

261
00:24:48,829 --> 00:24:49,829
Mom.

262
00:24:50,557 --> 00:24:51,600
Yes.

263
00:24:52,782 --> 00:24:54,727
Call me as soon as you arrive.

264
00:24:56,092 --> 00:24:58,174
Take care of yourself, okay?

265
00:25:00,940 --> 00:25:01,940
Mom.

266
00:25:04,077 --> 00:25:05,077
Yes.

267
00:25:07,940 --> 00:25:09,048
Mom.

268
00:25:13,269 --> 00:25:14,682
I'll see you later.

269
00:25:15,349 --> 00:25:16,888
Sure.

270
00:25:21,413 --> 00:25:25,703
It's probably the last chance
since he leaves for the U.S. soon.

271
00:25:27,381 --> 00:25:29,279
Don't you want to meet him,
even if you have to lie?

272
00:25:30,821 --> 00:25:31,865
Did you meet him?

273
00:25:35,668 --> 00:25:37,047
I don't want to say it,

274
00:25:40,093 --> 00:25:43,512
but did you meet Jun Seo?

275
00:25:45,685 --> 00:25:46,685
No.

276
00:25:47,541 --> 00:25:49,032
Good.

277
00:26:00,287 --> 00:26:01,469
Here you are.

278
00:26:01,469 --> 00:26:02,710
Right.

279
00:26:02,710 --> 00:26:05,452
Thanks for doing this every time.

280
00:26:05,452 --> 00:26:08,264
These chestnuts look so tasty, don't they?

281
00:26:09,357 --> 00:26:11,446
It's nothing.

282
00:26:11,446 --> 00:26:14,918
I just shared what I got from the hotel.

283
00:26:14,918 --> 00:26:16,432
Where is Jun Seo?

284
00:26:19,860 --> 00:26:23,307
Jun Seo is...

285
00:26:24,329 --> 00:26:26,173
I'll get him.

286
00:26:30,610 --> 00:26:33,227
It seemed like something bad had happened.

287
00:26:33,227 --> 00:26:35,013
He drank during the day.

288
00:26:36,122 --> 00:26:38,084
Did Jun Seo drink during the daytime?

289
00:26:39,929 --> 00:26:42,154
I know.

290
00:26:42,154 --> 00:26:43,373
Isn't it odd?

291
00:27:00,715 --> 00:27:03,002
Jun Seo. Yoon Jun Seo.

292
00:27:06,536 --> 00:27:08,883
- You came.
- Did you drink again?

293
00:27:10,761 --> 00:27:12,052
Manager Kim came.

294
00:27:15,497 --> 00:27:17,005
What is wrong with you these days?

295
00:27:18,604 --> 00:27:21,186
You've been holding up well,
but why are you like that these days?

296
00:27:21,186 --> 00:27:24,339
Why are you drinking all the time?
Keep yourself together.

297
00:27:25,937 --> 00:27:28,277
I'm sober. Let's go.

298
00:27:32,596 --> 00:27:35,966
What? Did Eun Seo?

299
00:27:37,933 --> 00:27:39,578
Didn't you know that?

300
00:27:39,578 --> 00:27:41,346
I don't know about the details.

301
00:27:41,346 --> 00:27:45,193
She said Director Han found her
a position at a hotel in Seoul.

302
00:27:45,193 --> 00:27:47,573
She came to say goodbye yesterday
and said she was going to Seoul.

303
00:27:47,961 --> 00:27:49,301
To Seoul?

304
00:27:53,851 --> 00:27:55,158
Is Eun Seo going to Seoul?

305
00:27:56,770 --> 00:27:57,782
Yes.

306
00:27:59,827 --> 00:28:03,218
I thought you all knew it already.

307
00:28:03,218 --> 00:28:05,691
Jun Seo, you are leaving for
the U.S. next month.

308
00:28:05,691 --> 00:28:10,542
So I assumed she met you to say farewell.
That's why I just said it.

309
00:28:16,394 --> 00:28:17,669
Jun Seo.

310
00:28:56,775 --> 00:28:57,896
Jun Seo.

311
00:29:00,166 --> 00:29:01,226
Yu Mi.

312
00:29:04,454 --> 00:29:06,114
You are all here.

313
00:29:07,408 --> 00:29:09,010
I came over to say "goodbye."

314
00:29:09,783 --> 00:29:11,505
I'm going to Seoul today.

315
00:29:13,718 --> 00:29:14,818
We need to talk.

316
00:29:16,735 --> 00:29:17,778
Jun Seo.

317
00:29:21,319 --> 00:29:22,408
We need to talk in private.

318
00:29:25,463 --> 00:29:26,465
Jun Seo.

319
00:29:31,662 --> 00:29:32,662
Go.

320
00:30:20,804 --> 00:30:24,766
You could've just left.
Why did you come here?

321
00:30:25,732 --> 00:30:27,376
I'm regretting it, too.

322
00:30:28,356 --> 00:30:30,228
Don't be like that.

323
00:30:30,228 --> 00:30:33,567
Jun Seo won't betray Shin Yu Mi
even if you don't do anything.

324
00:30:36,052 --> 00:30:38,775
Are you blaming me?

325
00:30:40,868 --> 00:30:44,069
Me? Blaming you?

326
00:30:44,988 --> 00:30:45,988
Blaming whom?

327
00:30:48,149 --> 00:30:50,781
Han Tae Seok. What a coward.

328
00:30:50,781 --> 00:30:54,062
I can't even be honest with her
because I'm scared of losing her again.

329
00:30:55,365 --> 00:30:56,432
Tae Seok.

330
00:30:56,860 --> 00:30:58,288
Don't bother.

331
00:30:59,835 --> 00:31:01,064
Don't blame yourself.

332
00:31:02,324 --> 00:31:04,774
I'm way worse than you are.

333
00:31:07,419 --> 00:31:09,495
If Jun Seo finds out the truth,

334
00:31:10,899 --> 00:31:13,006
he might kill me.

335
00:31:14,403 --> 00:31:16,071
What do you mean?

336
00:31:26,315 --> 00:31:27,526
Why are you leaving?

337
00:31:30,492 --> 00:31:32,694
I'm the one who should leave.
Why are you leaving?

338
00:31:36,253 --> 00:31:37,967
I know you're leaving.

339
00:31:39,789 --> 00:31:41,713
I know that, but...

340
00:31:44,452 --> 00:31:46,006
I was tired of waiting for you to leave.

341
00:31:48,204 --> 00:31:49,429
I was tired of waiting.

342
00:31:57,412 --> 00:31:58,711
Where are you going?

343
00:31:59,676 --> 00:32:01,352
Where are you going in Seoul?

344
00:32:08,444 --> 00:32:10,094
I'm not going to Seoul.

345
00:32:14,301 --> 00:32:16,287
You're the only one who knows this.

346
00:32:19,612 --> 00:32:23,302
I'm leaving with Tae Seok.

347
00:32:26,331 --> 00:32:28,438
He asked me to run away with him.

348
00:32:30,748 --> 00:32:32,199
He sounds like someone I know, isn't he?

349
00:32:33,644 --> 00:32:36,553
- Eun Seo.
- I promised Tae Seok.

350
00:32:38,271 --> 00:32:43,039
I'll live for him from now on.

351
00:32:45,973 --> 00:32:48,710
But it can be hard to do that here.

352
00:32:48,710 --> 00:32:52,063
We're going to start a new life together
somewhere else.

353
00:32:55,381 --> 00:32:56,672
Are you...

354
00:33:02,989 --> 00:33:07,650
going to live with Tae Seok?

355
00:33:09,622 --> 00:33:10,776
I mean it.

356
00:33:12,204 --> 00:33:16,432
I mean it, and so does he.

357
00:33:22,546 --> 00:33:24,827
It was my mistake the other day.

358
00:33:27,498 --> 00:33:29,633
I shouldn't have...

359
00:33:29,633 --> 00:33:32,162
said that to you the other day.

360
00:33:36,130 --> 00:33:37,682
That was my bad.

361
00:33:39,728 --> 00:33:41,859
I'm really embarrassed.

362
00:33:44,406 --> 00:33:46,266
So, you should think...

363
00:33:47,456 --> 00:33:52,329
it was good of you
to say no to me that day.

364
00:33:58,208 --> 00:33:59,377
Talking of that day,

365
00:34:01,711 --> 00:34:03,530
thank you for saying "no."

366
00:34:04,481 --> 00:34:05,661
I thought...

367
00:34:11,898 --> 00:34:13,551
you knew how I felt.

368
00:34:15,714 --> 00:34:16,862
I knew.

369
00:34:17,753 --> 00:34:19,197
And I know how you feel.

370
00:34:21,123 --> 00:34:25,099
But we both know...

371
00:34:25,099 --> 00:34:27,046
that we can't be together.

372
00:34:31,602 --> 00:34:35,191
Don't forget that I know how you feel.

373
00:34:36,770 --> 00:34:38,405
I really do.

374
00:34:41,427 --> 00:34:47,575
Your love for me will live in my heart.

375
00:34:49,322 --> 00:34:52,797
So, I have no regrets or resentment.

376
00:34:56,889 --> 00:34:58,563
You shouldn't forget that.

377
00:35:01,186 --> 00:35:04,061
Don't forget I know everything
about how you feel.

378
00:35:07,474 --> 00:35:10,422
Don't regret anything,
no matter what happens.

379
00:35:12,227 --> 00:35:13,641
You shouldn't regret anything...

380
00:35:18,475 --> 00:35:23,147
no matter what happens.

381
00:35:26,066 --> 00:35:27,221
Okay?

382
00:35:34,938 --> 00:35:37,057
Look at you.

383
00:35:37,057 --> 00:35:40,645
What can I do if you look like
you regret it already?

384
00:35:40,645 --> 00:35:42,373
I told you not to.

385
00:35:46,722 --> 00:35:47,901
I should get going, then.

386
00:35:56,867 --> 00:35:57,965
I'm regretting it.

387
00:36:02,386 --> 00:36:04,061
I really am regretting it.

388
00:36:47,681 --> 00:36:50,451
Lay on your left side, please.

389
00:36:50,451 --> 00:36:53,031
Pull your knees to your belly.

390
00:37:49,743 --> 00:37:50,840
It hurt, didn't it?

391
00:37:52,669 --> 00:37:53,728
It did a little.

392
00:37:57,752 --> 00:37:59,967
He should be around.

393
00:37:59,967 --> 00:38:01,677
He was so anxious.

394
00:38:01,677 --> 00:38:04,412
He looked much sicklier than you.

395
00:38:35,014 --> 00:38:36,306
When did you come?

396
00:38:38,183 --> 00:38:41,145
I just came.

397
00:38:42,823 --> 00:38:45,313
You had your test today, didn't you?

398
00:38:51,016 --> 00:38:52,098
Did it hurt?

399
00:38:54,263 --> 00:38:55,461
A little.

400
00:38:56,618 --> 00:38:57,733
It hurt just this much.

401
00:38:58,851 --> 00:39:02,005
Did it?

402
00:39:06,638 --> 00:39:07,877
I see.

403
00:39:17,219 --> 00:39:19,687
What's wrong with this? It's unusual.

404
00:39:30,946 --> 00:39:34,562
What's wrong with you?
You said you would take care of me.

405
00:39:35,432 --> 00:39:37,323
I'm sorry.

406
00:40:34,304 --> 00:40:36,537
Jun Seo, it's me.

407
00:40:36,537 --> 00:40:39,571
You haven't forgotten about
the family gathering tonight, have you?

408
00:40:40,282 --> 00:40:44,082
I'm in Seoul now, and will go straight
to your parents' home in Sokcho.

409
00:40:44,082 --> 00:40:45,131
See you later.

410
00:40:46,265 --> 00:40:50,456
Also, are you drinking now by any chance?

411
00:40:50,456 --> 00:40:52,050
Please don't drink.

412
00:40:57,433 --> 00:40:59,875
Is this where Shin Yu Mi is?

413
00:41:01,073 --> 00:41:03,489
Yu Mi, it's Dr. Kim.

414
00:41:03,489 --> 00:41:06,732
I told you to revisit to check,
but I don't think that's necessary.

415
00:41:06,732 --> 00:41:09,931
Your test result shows
that your hand has completely healed.

416
00:41:09,931 --> 00:41:11,279
Congratulations.

417
00:41:11,279 --> 00:41:13,681
You should throw a party again
with your fiancé.

418
00:41:20,704 --> 00:41:23,522
Jun Seo is getting late.

419
00:41:24,329 --> 00:41:25,751
He'll be here soon.

420
00:41:25,751 --> 00:41:27,471
Let's start eating without him.

421
00:41:27,471 --> 00:41:30,499
But it's been a while
since we had a family gathering.

422
00:41:31,087 --> 00:41:32,087
Right.

423
00:41:34,559 --> 00:41:36,864
Are you worried, Yu Mi?

424
00:41:36,864 --> 00:41:38,144
Don't worry.

425
00:41:38,144 --> 00:41:41,232
He'll probably be here soon,
since he hasn't called.

426
00:41:41,232 --> 00:41:45,418
He always calls when he's running late,
even if it's for ten minutes.

427
00:41:47,527 --> 00:41:49,505
It should be him, Sin Ae.

428
00:41:49,505 --> 00:41:50,639
I'll get it.

429
00:41:50,639 --> 00:41:51,833
I'll get it.

430
00:41:55,233 --> 00:41:56,592
Are you drunk?

431
00:41:57,087 --> 00:41:58,656
You smell like alcohol.

432
00:41:58,656 --> 00:42:00,309
Jun Seo, get yourself together.

433
00:42:01,149 --> 00:42:02,189
I'm sorry.

434
00:42:06,931 --> 00:42:07,974
I am sorry.

435
00:42:08,908 --> 00:42:10,130
I'm late.

436
00:42:10,130 --> 00:42:11,531
Jun Seo.

437
00:42:11,531 --> 00:42:14,036
What's wrong with you?

438
00:42:16,242 --> 00:42:19,324
I am sorry, Mom.

439
00:42:21,695 --> 00:42:23,517
I hung out with a friend...

440
00:42:23,517 --> 00:42:26,381
Jun Seo, why are you so drunk?

441
00:42:28,585 --> 00:42:29,807
Are you all right?

442
00:42:29,807 --> 00:42:30,844
I'm fine.

443
00:42:33,631 --> 00:42:34,631
Go away.

444
00:42:35,015 --> 00:42:37,307
Yoon Jun Seo.

445
00:42:38,391 --> 00:42:40,058
Are you okay, Jun Seo?

446
00:42:45,573 --> 00:42:46,609
I am fine.

447
00:42:48,911 --> 00:42:50,227
I'm all right.

448
00:42:53,407 --> 00:42:54,587
I am sorry.

449
00:42:55,287 --> 00:42:56,546
Mom, I am sorry.

450
00:43:09,063 --> 00:43:12,173
I am sorry. What's wrong with me?

451
00:43:16,442 --> 00:43:17,573
Jun Seo.

452
00:43:18,874 --> 00:43:20,685
Jun Seo, what's the matter?

453
00:43:25,731 --> 00:43:27,061
It's broken.

454
00:43:29,617 --> 00:43:31,757
Mom, I'll get another one.

455
00:43:40,643 --> 00:43:41,872
Jun Seo.

456
00:44:26,905 --> 00:44:27,914
Hello.

457
00:44:29,695 --> 00:44:31,170
Yes, Doctor.

458
00:44:32,785 --> 00:44:36,603
A message? No, I haven't.

459
00:44:38,752 --> 00:44:41,059
Okay, thank you.

460
00:44:41,729 --> 00:44:42,843
Yes.

461
00:44:58,300 --> 00:44:59,606
Jun Seo.

462
00:45:08,964 --> 00:45:10,261
You knew.

463
00:45:14,964 --> 00:45:19,463
You knew my hand got healed.

464
00:45:25,668 --> 00:45:26,983
I'm sorry.

465
00:45:28,415 --> 00:45:31,308
I was going to tell you,

466
00:45:31,308 --> 00:45:32,927
but I didn't want you to know.

467
00:45:34,907 --> 00:45:38,712
I thought that if my hand got better,
you would leave me.

468
00:45:39,532 --> 00:45:41,616
That's why I lied.

469
00:45:43,084 --> 00:45:46,392
I didn't want to lose you,
even if I had to lie.

470
00:45:48,612 --> 00:45:53,903
That's great news,
and you should've told me that earlier.

471
00:45:54,596 --> 00:45:55,943
Jun Seo.

472
00:45:57,892 --> 00:45:58,966
I mean it.

473
00:46:02,427 --> 00:46:05,256
You can paint again.

474
00:46:05,256 --> 00:46:06,707
I am very happy for you.

475
00:46:10,215 --> 00:46:13,842
I really...

476
00:46:16,152 --> 00:46:18,634
wanted to have you for myself,
even if I had to lie.

477
00:46:21,407 --> 00:46:23,890
I wished my hand wouldn't get better.

478
00:46:26,952 --> 00:46:27,971
I know.

479
00:46:29,487 --> 00:46:30,746
I get it.

480
00:46:34,904 --> 00:46:36,258
I understand.

481
00:46:40,687 --> 00:46:43,963
Then, don't leave.

482
00:46:44,991 --> 00:46:48,019
Don't go to Eun Seo.

483
00:46:51,087 --> 00:46:52,826
I'm not going to Eun Seo.

484
00:46:53,951 --> 00:46:57,307
No, I won't go to her.

485
00:47:01,865 --> 00:47:03,146
That won't happen.

486
00:47:04,815 --> 00:47:06,684
I just want to travel for a few days.

487
00:47:08,145 --> 00:47:09,491
Will you let me?

488
00:47:12,711 --> 00:47:14,715
Will you forgive me?

489
00:47:15,241 --> 00:47:16,307
Forgive you?

490
00:47:19,393 --> 00:47:21,122
I should be the one
asking for forgiveness.

491
00:47:25,617 --> 00:47:27,299
I'm sorry for not getting myself together.

492
00:47:29,640 --> 00:47:31,251
I'm sorry for making you worried.

493
00:47:37,729 --> 00:47:40,547
Eun Seo moved on when she was
leaving these mugs behind.

494
00:47:43,559 --> 00:47:45,579
She has moved on,

495
00:47:47,592 --> 00:47:49,875
but I was a fool, not being able to do it.

496
00:47:54,415 --> 00:47:56,496
I'll be back after clearing my head.

497
00:47:56,496 --> 00:47:58,202
Just give me a couple of days.

498
00:47:59,713 --> 00:48:01,228
Then we will go to the U.S.

499
00:48:19,317 --> 00:48:20,988
While I'm gone,

500
00:48:22,579 --> 00:48:24,558
can you keep these mugs?

501
00:48:28,956 --> 00:48:30,620
When I'm back,

502
00:48:33,396 --> 00:48:35,792
these will be nothing more than mugs.

503
00:49:08,914 --> 00:49:11,445
Choi Eun Seo, are you scared?

504
00:49:12,779 --> 00:49:15,837
Ms. Choi.

505
00:49:20,042 --> 00:49:22,038
Do you know how painful it is?

506
00:49:23,571 --> 00:49:25,469
It hurts a lot.

507
00:49:28,179 --> 00:49:30,429
But do I have to do the test again?

508
00:49:30,429 --> 00:49:33,824
You did well last time.
Why are you scared?

509
00:49:35,092 --> 00:49:37,063
You said it's nothing.

510
00:49:38,021 --> 00:49:40,629
Then you should try it yourself this time.

511
00:49:41,058 --> 00:49:43,294
No, why do I do that?

512
00:49:46,963 --> 00:49:48,662
I wish I could.

513
00:49:49,858 --> 00:49:53,319
Must I go through this painful test?

514
00:49:56,572 --> 00:50:01,285
Even if it hurts,
there's no guarantee I will get better.

515
00:50:04,372 --> 00:50:06,437
Why do I need to do this?

516
00:50:17,586 --> 00:50:19,055
Do that for me.

517
00:50:22,731 --> 00:50:24,808
I know what I said is not going to work.

518
00:50:31,202 --> 00:50:32,202
Why are you saying that?

519
00:50:33,611 --> 00:50:35,205
You don't like me.

520
00:50:40,611 --> 00:50:41,732
Tae Seok.

521
00:50:46,498 --> 00:50:49,756
Could you get me a lucky charm?

522
00:50:55,851 --> 00:50:57,391
The necklace.

523
00:51:00,939 --> 00:51:02,350
Can I get it back?

524
00:51:07,365 --> 00:51:09,534
I'll hold it whenever I feel pain.

525
00:51:11,333 --> 00:51:13,333
I will have that as my lucky charm.

526
00:51:15,123 --> 00:51:16,325
Can I do that?

527
00:51:19,771 --> 00:51:20,771
Yes, you can.

528
00:51:22,472 --> 00:51:25,405
You can have it.

529
00:51:26,987 --> 00:51:28,255
That wouldn't be a big deal.

530
00:51:31,659 --> 00:51:37,021
But can I give you something else,
instead of the necklace?

531
00:52:40,066 --> 00:52:41,291
Please come to the injection room.

532
00:53:47,805 --> 00:53:48,940
Jun Seo.
